OL,3,GNEWSALGBT+ rugby club make history with
OL,4,Aglobal trophy win
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe south-west of England's first LGBT+
OL,7,Finclusive rugby team have made club
OL,8,Fhistory by winning a trophy at an
OL,9,Finternational tournament.
OL,11,FBristol Bisons RFC won the Hoagland Cup
OL,12,Fat the 2026 Bingham Cup for the first
OL,13,Ftime in Brisbane, Australia.
OL,15,FSasha Acheson, Bristol Bisons director
OL,16,Fof rugby, said the trophy win was "six
OL,17,Fyears in the making".
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
