OL,3,GNEWSALGBT+ rugby club make history with
OL,4,Aglobal trophy win
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We arrived as underdogs, beat
OL,7,Fexceptional men's teams from across the
OL,8,Fworld and imposed ourselves physically
OL,9,Fwithout ever moving away from our
OL,10,Frugby: hearts on fire, heads on ice,"
OL,11,Fshe said.
